      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>son of rabbi Sim\u1e25a, (may his) s(oul be) b(ound up) in the (bundle of life),</li>\n<li>should act in this matter</li>\n<li>according to their proper judgment.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>If they consecrate the community</li>\n<li>on the Sabbath and afterwards</li>\n<li>inform the community</li>\n<li>that the excommunication will ban</li>\n<li>two paths in</li>\n<li>the synagogue,</li>\n<li>may it be inhabited,</li>\n<li>...</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
